                <pb facs="0584" n="1238" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg1238"/>

                <head>No. 579.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish
                        to Mr. Cushing</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-12-11"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 11,
                        1874</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cushing</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Minister, Madrid</hi></p>
                <p>If Spain will pay indemnities as indicated in my telegram of November 28, without
                    any admissions or implications on the part of this Government, you are
                    authorized to discuss and arrange details.</p>
                <p>* * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>Should you have doubt on any point, you will refer to this Government, and before
                    concluding a settlement you will submit its terms.</p>
                <closer><signed>FISH, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
